{"ticker":"EXPE","updated":"2026-10-23T22:57:35Z","profile":{"longName":"Expedia Group, Inc.","shortName":"Expedia Group, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Travel Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.expediagroup.com","fullTimeEmployees":16000,"marketCap":34687582208,"trailingPE":18.051844,"forwardPE":11.7596655,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.2094002,"pegRatio":0.78,"targetMeanPrice":334.94287,"targetHighPrice":430.0,"targetLowPrice":235.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":35,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.14,"earningsGrowth":1.887,"grossMargins":0.90433,"operatingMargins":0.1898,"profitMargins":0.12968001,"totalRevenue":15699999744,"beta":1.362,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":342.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":185.34,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.64},"summary":"Expedia Group, Inc. operates as an online travel company in the United States and internationally. The company operates through B2C, B2B, and trivago segments. The B2C segment includes Brand Expedia, a full-service online travel brand offers various travel products and services; Hotels.com for lodging accommodations; Vrbo, an online marketplace for the alternative accommodations; and Orbitz, Travelocity, ebookers, and Wotif Group. The B2B segment provides various travel and non-travel companies including airlines, offline travel agents, online retailers, corporate travel management, and financial institutions who leverage its travel technology and tap into its diverse supply to augment their offerings and market Expedia Group rates and availabilities to its travelers. The trivago segment sends referrals to online travel companies and travel service providers from hotel metasearch websites. In addition, it provides brand advertising through online and offline channels, loyalty programs, mobile apps, and search engine marketing, as well as metasearch, social media, direct and personalized traveler communications on its websites, and through direct e-mail communication with its travelers. The company was formerly known as Expedia, Inc. and changed its name to Expedia Group, Inc. in March 2018. Expedia Group, Inc. was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in Seattle, Washington.","summary_zh":"Expedia Group, Inc. 是一家在美國和國際上營運的線上旅遊公司。該公司透過 B2C、B2B 和 trivago 部門進行營運。 B2C 細分市場包括 Brand Expedia，這是一個提供各種旅遊產品和服務的全方位服務線上旅遊品牌； Hotels.com for lodging accommodations; Vrbo，替代住宿的線上市場；以及 Orbitz、Travelocity、電子書商和 Wotif Group。 B2B 部門為各種旅遊和非旅遊公司提供服務，包括航空公司、離線旅行社、線上零售商、企業旅遊管理和金融機構，這些公司利用其旅遊技術並利用其多樣化的供應來增強其產品和服務，並向旅客推銷 Expedia Group 的價格和可用性。 trivago 部門透過飯店元搜尋網站向線上旅遊公司和旅遊服務提供者發送推薦。此外，該公司還透過線上和線下管道、忠誠度計劃、行動應用程式和搜尋引擎行銷、元搜尋、社交媒體、網站上的直接和個人化旅行者溝通以及透過與旅行者的直接電子郵件溝通來提供品牌廣告。該公司前身為 Expedia, Inc.，於 2018 年 3 月更名為 Expedia Group, Inc.。 Expedia Group, Inc. 成立於 1996 年，總部位於華盛頓州西雅圖。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"旅遊服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":214.84,"h":216.0,"l":211.75,"c":213.35,"v":1581300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":213.0,"h":214.46,"l":211.88,"c":213.63,"v":1651400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":213.63,"h":214.87,"l":211.22,"c":212.21,"v":1389800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":212.92,"h":215.27,"l":210.28,"c":214.71,"v":1419900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":215.0,"h":216.21,"l":213.5,"c":214.8,"v":1255300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":209.83,"h":212.72,"l":209.01,"c":212.12,"v":1120700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":212.4,"h":214.8,"l":210.03,"c":212.54,"v":1191300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":213.46,"h":217.0,"l":212.49,"c":216.52,"v":1103700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":215.92,"h":219.1,"l":211.53,"c":214.95,"v":1353200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":214.87,"h":217.78,"l":214.04,"c":217.2,"v":1358700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":217.11,"h":218.0,"l":215.87,"c":217.7,"v":1168500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":217.19,"h":218.52,"l":212.3,"c":215.49,"v":1076100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":216.23,"h":222.1,"l":215.98,"c":221.36,"v":1049900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":221.36,"h":223.22,"l":219.55,"c":222.19,"v":970100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":222.35,"h":229.0,"l":221.25,"c":228.24,"v":2734000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":227.96,"